rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>" <<Boundary-ZmVtY29yZQ==>> {
    rectangle "==Direct solvers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nShifted sparse direct solves with symbolic reuse, LU with a user ordering, block low-rank factorisation, mixed precision, nested dissection." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Directsolvers
    rectangle "==Krylov solvers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nCG, MINRES, GMRES, BiCGStab, COCR, QMR, IDR(s), GCRO-DR for real and complex systems." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Krylovsolvers
    rectangle "==Eigensolvers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nKrylov-Schur, LOBPCG, Jacobi-Davidson, quadratic and nonlinear eigenproblems, contour integral, Chebyshev filtering, real Arnoldi for the 2D modes, sensitivities." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Eigensolvers
    rectangle "==Preconditioners\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nSmoothed-aggregation multigrid (scalar and elastic), auxiliary-space Maxwell and divergence solvers, Schwarz, field-split and incomplete factorisations." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Preconditioners
    rectangle "==Time, nonlinear, sweeps\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nTime integration, Newton and optimisation, matrix exponential action, reduced-order frequency sweeps and matrix-free high-order operators." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Timenonlinearsweeps
    rectangle "==Finite-element basics\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nLagrange P1/P2 elements and quadrature, the 2D edge-element basis, derived fields, PML coordinate stretching, Floquet pairs and material properties per domain." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Finiteelementbasics
    rectangle "==Material specification\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nTOML material files with explicit units, tensors, dispersion models evaluated at the wavelength, provenance and the library loader." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Materialspecification
    rectangle "==Optical mode sets\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nOptical modes of a 2D cross-section as a field-evaluable set with the material data to evaluate them." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Opticalmodesets
    rectangle "==Frame and sections\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe one place that knows the wafer axes (x lateral, z normal, waves along +y)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Frameandsections
    rectangle "==Expressions\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nA small safe expression evaluator for user input (a copy of geom's kept equal by a corpus test), and the typed tree over complex field values that the reductions of results evaluate, and the text formulas parsed into it (ADR 90)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Expressions
    rectangle "==Runtime services\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe shared worker pool, stage log and cancel, the warm-start context of the shift-and-invert eigensolvers (ADR 96), and refusal of NaN and infinity." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Runtimeservices
    rectangle "==Mesh\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe native mixed-cell mesh, the exchange mesh the physics take, simplex meshes with their numbering of unknowns, draw-only meshes and quality statistics." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Mesh
    rectangle "==Mesh files\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe compact lossless .fmsh format for meshes and results and its entropy coder." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Meshfiles
    rectangle "==Fixtures and test kit\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nTest meshes and the SOI wire cross-section used by the tests of every physics crate." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Fixturesandtestkit
    rectangle "==Meshing facade\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nMeshPlan and mesh_model (the one way to mesh a geom model), the serialisable request and report, sizing from the physics, and the 2D triangulation core." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Meshingfacade
    rectangle "==3D meshing\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe lattice tetrahedral mesher on Domain3, Rivara refinement, the adapter from a 3D geom model, adaptive meshing driven by exact faces, face sizes and max_dev, and the curved (quadratic) edges of boundary cells." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.3Dmeshing
    rectangle "==Structured absorbing layers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nStructured PML around a box-shaped or geom-model mesh: prisms, hexahedra, quads, labels." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Structuredabsorbinglayers
    rectangle "==Meshing validation harness\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nA small independent scalar Helmholtz solver with PML used to validate meshes." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Meshingvalidationharness
    rectangle "==Metric fields\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nRiemannian metrics in 2D and 3D, metric fields, the simplex working mesh and per-phase timers." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Metricfields
    rectangle "==Adaptation operators\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nEdge split, collapse, flip and smoothing on the working meshes in 2D and 3D, with the vertex classification." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Adaptationoperators
    rectangle "==Adaptation drivers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nPasses of operators until the mesh conforms to the metric, with geometry oracles saying where a boundary vertex may go." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Adaptationdrivers
    rectangle "==Error estimators\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nError estimation and the solve-estimate-adapt loop; the Maxwell residual estimator for edge elements." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Errorestimators
    rectangle "==Matrices and vectors\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe one matrix type Csr over a generic scalar, block storage, multivector kernels, operator interfaces, dense helpers, Matrix Market, problem bundles and test-problem generators." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Matricesandvectors
    rectangle "==Linear algebra driver\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe door the physics kernels use: a direct solve, eigenpairs near a shift, and the solver interface for models." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.femcore.Linearalgebradriver
  }

  component "==geom\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nLean CSG-over-B-rep geometry kernel: feature lists, named regions and boundaries, selectors, exact projection oracles. Depends on serde and optional rayon only." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.geom
}

